  "feedbacks": [],
  "notes": [
    "Complete list: 22 actions (src/actions.js, one setActionDefinitions call) and no feedbacks (the module does not define any). The shared option definitions live in src/setup.js (Fields: FrameBuffer at line 2, GPI 10, Layer 18, TakeId 26); the provenance of each action points to its entry in src/actions.js.",
    "Protocol: RossTalk text commands over TCP (config port default 7788, host validated with Regex.IP, port with Regex.PORT). Option values are interpolated into the command string without further validation; CUSTOM sends any text typed into \"Command\".",
    "The framebuffer option is 1-based in the UI and sent as fb - 1 (src/actions.js:12-16).",
    "The number fields declare no asInteger and the textinput of CUSTOM has no useVariables; the module is built on @companion-module/base ~1.11, so options do not support expressions."
  ]
